## Response Format

In addition to above output, YOU MUST generate a **concise summary** (NOT the full execution/implementation report) wrapped in `<Response>` tags.

**IMPORTANT: You MUST wrap your response in `<Response>` tags**: The system depends on these tags to extract your summary. If you omit them, the entire raw output will be used as the proposal text, and may cause downstream failures.

