## 4. API Surface — Alerts

### `POST /api/v1/alerts/register` — Register Alert Configuration

**Sample Payload:**
```json
{
  "alert_key": "dzhu2_alert",
  "alert_namespace": "confluence_experiment123",
  "alert_configs": [
    {
      "reference_period": {
        "type": "absolute",
        "start": "2023-10-01T08:00:00",
        "end": "2023-10-01T17:00:00"
      },
      "metric_namespace": "confluence.error_rate",
      "metrics_excluded": ["confluence.error_rate.feature_A.mean"],
      "alert_conditions": [
        {
          "type": "single",
          "condition": {
            "measure": "std",
            "operator": ">=",
            "tolerance": 3
          }
        }
      ],
      "tag_filters": [
        {"key": "feature_name", "operator": "=", "value": "daily_transaction_count"}
      ],
      "recipients": [
        {"type": "slack", "values": ["#ml-alerts"]},
        {"type": "jsm_ops", "values": ["eng-ml-platform"]}
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

**Alert Condition Types:**
- `single`: Evaluate one condition (measure: `std`, `expected_value`; operators: `>=`, `<=`, `>`, `<`)
- `group` (post-MVP): AND/OR logic over multiple conditions
- `complex` (future): N-of-M threshold conditions

**Reference Period Types:**
- `absolute`: Fixed start/end timestamps
- `relative`: Sliding window (e.g., `-2w` = last 2 weeks, `-30d` = last 30 days)

**Source**: [ML Lens Metrics API](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/MLP/pages/5806815768), [ML Lens Alerting Requirements](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/MLP/pages/5989280688)

