## 10. Key Terminology / Taxonomy

| Term | Definition |
|------|-----------|
| **metric_namespace_and_key** (FQDN) | Full dotted identifier: `kyc.reranking.NDCG@1`. SDK's single field. |
| **Metric namespace** | Everything before the last dot (stored as `namespace` column) |
| **Metric key** | Final segment after last dot (stored as `metric_key` column) |
| **Tags** | Free-form key-value dictionary on each event; used for filtering, NOT for baseline identity |
| **Metric series** | Time-ordered sequence of events sharing same FQDN; unit of statistical computation |
| **Reference window** | Historical period for baseline (sliding or fixed) |
| **Alert config** | JSON registration with conditions, tag filters, recipients |
| **Observo** | Atlassian-managed service operating StarRocks clusters |
| **StarRocks** | Columnar OLAP store (forked from Apache Doris) — the underlying database engine |
| **Streamhub** | Atlassian's event bus (Kafka-based) for async metric delivery to ML Lens |

