- [LDR — Skill Eval Framework](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/qura/pages/7083544728)
- [Lossless Compaction Eval — Dataset & Results Guide](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/~71202068b5515e3bbb4d128b769cdf59a3ec9a/pages/6978868305)
