- [Batch Evaluation Architecture](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/H3/pages/5657753622)
- [Project - Multi-Turn Evals for Batch Evals](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/~7120204cd8d80c30a04786b126ea9de3ddc4e4/pages/7047170722)
