## Executive Summary

The "rovo-eval" ecosystem at Atlassian encompasses **three distinct but complementary evaluation systems**, each with different programmatic invocation surfaces. For building an `rovo_eval_runner` tool, the most relevant are:

1. **Stratus Evals SDK** (`stratus-evals-sdk`) — The recommended Python SDK for programmatic eval runs (newest, most actively developed)
2. **Assistance-Service-Eval (ASE)** — The legacy Kotlin-based evaluation platform at `go/rovoeval` (maintenance mode)
3. **Batch Evaluations in ConvoAI** — The customer-facing product feature via GraphQL mutations in Agent Studio

