| Access Item | Required For | How to Obtain |
|-------------|--------------|---------------|
| SignalFx Org Access Token (API scope, read+write) | Detector CRUD, SignalFlow execute | OBSHELP ticket → Observability team provisions |
| SignalFx Team ID | Assigning detectors to team | From team URL in SignalFx UI |
| Sauron SSH key in repo | Automated deployment | Add Sauron public key to Bitbucket repo |
| Sauron webhook configured | Auto-deploy on merge | Configure in repo settings |
| Slack credential ID (`DxJ_pZzA0N0`) | Slack notifications | Global; already provisioned |
| OpsGenie credential ID (`D2c_4qUA4AA`) | OpsGenie notifications | Global; already provisioned |
| SignalFM CLI installed | Local testing | `pip install signalfm` or internal package |
| Terraform >= 0.13.4 | IaC execution | `brew install terraform` or Docker via SFM |
| SFx provider >= 9.25.0 | Current resource compatibility | Specified in `.sauron.yml` |

