Capabilities discovered (in-scope):

 • google_drive (42 tools): workspace_create_document (name + content in
   MD/ADF, optional folder) and workspace_update_document (with optimistic
   documentVersion locking) for doc creation/edit; docs_insert_text for
   append/segment-targeted writes;
   google_create_spreadsheet/update_spreadsheet_values (A1 notation,
   USER_ENTERED/RAW) for KPI tables; full permission CRUD
   (document_create_permission supports role ∈
   {owner,organizer,fileOrganizer,writer,commenter,reader} and type ∈
   {user,group,domain,anyone}, with expirationTime ≤1yr, plus an explicit
   concurrency warning "only last update is applied"); comment CRUD with
   startModifiedTime for incremental polling; revision controls with
   keepForever/published for archival; drive_get_changes change-feed;
   drive_get_information quota/export metadata.
 • gmail (12 tools): create_email (subject, content, recipients/cc/bcc as
   string arrays, sendTime ISO 8601 for scheduled send — substitutes for a
   cron); create_email_draft (with threadId); reply_email (RFC 2822 threaded
   via threadId+messageId+references); email_thread_search (Gmail query syntax
   incl. from:/subject:/label:/before:/after:, max 100); label
   list/modify/move/copy; email_get/email_thread_get
   (full/metadata/minimal/raw).
 • google_calendar (adjacent): calendar_create_event with RFC-5545 
   recurrenceRules anchors cadence and acts as a passive distribution
   mechanism.

Workflow coverage: ~80–90% covered out-of-the-box.
Compose→Publish→Notify→Track (Weekly Digest) and
Draft→Collab→Lock→Cascade-Distribute (Quarterly Narrative) both fully mappable
to existing calls; Google Group aliases handle distribution lists in a single
ACL/email call.

Key gaps (justify a new tool from Subtask 2):

  1 No template engine — Model Card/Experiment Report/Architecture
    Comparison/Digest/PIR/Narrative templates must live inside the skill.
  2 No programmatic Google Group membership enumeration — audience curation
    must rely on a Confluence config page.
  3 Drive Labels API is marked "Placeholder Dummy Action" → unreliable; use
    doc properties or folder layout.
  4 No PDF/HTML export for immutable archival.
  5 create_email has no attachment param — must distribute via link only.
  6 No bulk send / mail-merge / per-recipient personalization with
    rate-limiting.
  7 No post-send delivery confirmation.
  8 document_create_permission concurrency hazard (last-write-wins) requires
    skill-side serialization + verification via document_get_permissions.
  9 workspace_update_document requires manual version increment + retry on
    conflict.

Integration patterns documented: Compose→Publish→Notify→Track (weekly);
Draft→Collab→Lock→Cascade (quarterly); cross-skill handoffs to atlassian MCP
for Jira action items; explicit autonomous-vs-human-confirmation matrix
(autonomous for internal-group ACLs and scheduled digest send; human-confirm
for external-domain/anyone shares, ownership transfer, and quarterly
exec-visible sends — recommend create_email_draft as the default for Quarterly
Narrative).


