## 8. Authentication & Access Requirements

### Authentication Methods for AI Gateway Access

| Method | Environment | Recommended For |
|--------|-------------|-----------------|
| **Lanyard proxy** (SLAUTH) | Local | Development, debugging |
| **ASAP auth** | All (staging + prod) | Production, ML Studio, Databricks |
| **Build tokens** | Staging only (Bitbucket Pipelines) | CI/CD |

### Local Setup (Lanyard)
```bash
# Install Lanyard
brew tap atlassian/lanyard git@bitbucket.org:atlassian/lanyard-tap.git
brew install lanyard

# Configure in Lanyard UI:
# - Audience: ai-gateway
# - Groups: ai-gateway-evaluation-dl-all-atlassian-read
# - Get Config ID for HTTP proxy
```

**Environment variables (`.env`)**:
```env
X_ATLASSIAN_USER_ID=<your-atlassian-account-id>
X_ATLASSIAN_CLOUD_ID=<cloud-id>
X_ATLASSIAN_USECASE_ID=ai-experience-evaluation
LANYARD_CONFIG_AI_GATEWAY=<your-lanyard-config>
TOKENIZERS_PARALLELISM=false
```

### ML Studio / Databricks Setup (ASAP)
```bash
# Generate ASAP key
atlas asap key generate \
  -k databricks/atlassian-discover/ai-experience-evaluation/{username}-dev \
  -f my-key.yaml -o yaml

# Save key to key saver
atlas asap key save \
  -k databricks/atlassian-discover/ai-experience-evaluation/{username}-dev \
  -f my-key.yaml -s lanyard -e dev

# Whitelist use case
atlas ml aigateway usecase auth add \
  -e stg-east \
  -i ai-experience-evaluation \
  -p databricks/atlassian-discover/ai-experience-evaluation \
  -t ASAP_ISSUER
```

### SSAM Access Required
- SSAM group: `socrates-cb-aix-evaluation` (for Databricks workbench)
- AI Gateway evaluation group: `ai-gateway-evaluation-dl-all-atlassian-read`
- Use case ID whitelist required for ML Studio

**Source**: [AI Gateway Authentication Setup Guide](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/~7120209092413fa40e489dbbb5fd1e58fa771b/pages/6332130515/AI+Gateway+Authentication+Setup+Guide), [#2 AI-Eval Guide](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/AM3/pages/6467898471/2+AI-Eval+Guide)

