## 9. Metric Library (110+ Built-in)

### Categories & Example Metrics
| Category | Metrics |
|----------|---------|
| **Input+Output** | `compression_ratio`, `bleu_metric`, `rouge_metric`, `semantic_similarity`, `bert_score_metric`, `is_exact_match`, `difference_ratio`, `judge_relevance`, `judge_completeness`, `judge_quality`, `judge_title_relevance` |
| **Output-only** | `is_only_bullet_points`, `judge_conciseness`, `judge_assist_message` |
| **Input-only** | `word_count`, `token_count` |
| **Output+Reference** | `judge_coverage` |
| **Domain-specific** | ADF integrity, audio quality, whiteboard/diagramming quality, Jira issue quality |

### LLM Provider Support for Judges
Six client types: AI Gateway (OpenAI, Bedrock/Claude, Google), Ollama, Assistance Service, ConvoAI, CCSMarts, and TeamServe.

### Supported Models (via AI Gateway)
- `GPT_4O_MINI_LATEST`, `GPT4O_MINI`
- `GEMINI_2_0_FLASH_001`
- `ANTHROPIC_CLAUDE_V3_5_SONNET_V2`
- `SONNET4_V1`
- Other models available via `atlas ml aigateway usecase view`

**Source**: [AIX-Eval Metric Library](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/AM3/pages/3730271482), [AIX-Eval Overview](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/~7120203bd0205883eb4c12af95fe0e997be99f/pages/6522081308/AIX-Eval)

