─── Response ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────


                                 Key Findings

Tool surface (5 tools, all async/poll style):

 1 create_query(sql) — fire-and-forget SQL submission; returns statementId.
 2 get_query_status(statementId) — poll for result; no cancel, no cursor
   paging.
 3 get_flow_run_status(flowId, environment, lookbackHours) — Prefect-style
   flow telemetry (env defaults to production, lookback 24h).
 4 get_flow_run_logs(flowId, environment, runId) — flow logs.
 5 get_login_url() — SSO escalation path.

Boundary: MCP accepts any SQL string with no DML/DDL guard — skill must
lex-scan and reject writes. No paging, no cancel, no scheduler, no online
feature store, no Unity Catalog grants.

Skill coverage mapping (8 SKILLs): HIGH for cost_and_capacity_stewardship and
drift_triggered_retraining (SOP-1 step 2); HIGH for ml_incident_response
(SOP-3 step 3 cross-correlation); MED for ml_observability_and_slo (historical
mirror only — live drift needs the new ml_lens_query_client),
ml_evaluation_protocol, ml_launch_review_gate, mle_stakeholder_reporting; LOW
for symphony_orbit_governance.

13 canonical SQL templates produced (the deliverable):

 • Drift signals (§4): KS-statistic via ECDF window functions, PSI with
   smoothing, KL/Jensen-Shannon, NLP cosine ≥ 0.60 against baseline centroid,
   coverage/freshness/sparsity audit, SOP-3 request-log × feature ×
   connector-burst cross-correlation (encodes responsible-ai-api runbook
   patterns: tenant burst, ALB decoupling, gevent saturation, OTel sidecar
   race), multi-seed/k-fold sanity gate.
 • Cost roll-ups (§5): inference cost per request/model/endpoint, GPU
   utilization with over/under-provisioned verdicts, per-experiment budget
   enforcement (Agent Budget Guardrails: WARN_YELLOW@50%, WARN_RED@90%,
   HALT@hard_cap), actuals-validated SageMaker→TEAMServe ~59% savings
   comparison, cost-per-model-version (training+storage+serving), cohort cost
   narrative for Quarterly Impact Narrative.

Gaps requiring Subtask-2 tools: live ML Lens StarRocks (ml_lens_query_client),
semantic FinOps verbs (finops_cost_query), budget halt enforcement
(circuit_breaker_control), ORBIT lineage r/w (orbit_context_client).

Autonomy profile: SELECT/CTE/SHOW/DESCRIBE are autonomous Tier-1 with LIMIT 1M
cap and exponential backoff (2→30s, 5–15min hard cap); cross-tenant/UGC and
any DML require human confirmation; auth failure escalates via get_login_url.

Composition patterns documented for: SOP-1 drift→correlate→Jira→Slack→PIR
chain, per-experiment budget enforcement, Quarterly Narrative distribution
(Socrates → google_drive → gmail → atlassian), and launch-gate evidence
packaging.


8 actionable skill-author items listed (SQL-template library, read-only lexer
guard, async-poll helper, schema-discovery helper, pre-query freshness check,
provenance packaging, cost cap, handoff spec for finops_cost_query).
