                                 Key Findings

Tool surface (5 tools, all async/poll style):

 1 create_query(sql) — fire-and-forget SQL submission; returns statementId.
 2 get_query_status(statementId) — poll for result; no cancel, no cursor
   paging.
 3 get_flow_run_status(flowId, environment, lookbackHours) — Prefect-style
   flow telemetry (env defaults to production, lookback 24h).
 4 get_flow_run_logs(flowId, environment, runId) — flow logs.
 5 get_login_url() — SSO escalation path.

Boundary: MCP accepts any SQL string with no DML/DDL guard — skill must
lex-scan and reject writes. No paging, no cancel, no scheduler, no online
feature store, no Unity Catalog grants.

Skill coverage mapping (8 SKILLs): HIGH for cost_and_capacity_stewardship and
