## Finding 6: Performance Characteristics & Rate Limits

### ORBIT Context API
- **Latency target:** p99< 100ms for Feature Store retrieval
- **Ranking freshness:** p95 < 24h (batch daily refresh)
- **Pipeline throughput:** ≥200M user-entity pairs/day
- **Pipeline execution time:** ~1.5 hours (optimized from 3h)

### MLFS Serving
- **Rate limiting:** configurable per feature endpoint (e.g., 1000 req/s, burst2000)
- **Multi-region support:** tenant-based shard routing
- **Tier:** Tier 1 (highest operational priority)

### ML Lens
- **Metrics ingestion:** 200M+ metrics ingested weekly
- **~100 alerts sent weekly** across all use cases
- **SDK:** Python-only currently (Node/Kotlin gap identified)

