## 3. TTD/TTH/TTR/TTC Computation Logic

### 3.1 Computation Function Design

```python
def compute_incident_metrics(key_timestamps: dict) -> dict:
    """
    Compute TTD, TTH, TTR, TTC from incident key timestamps.
    All inputs are ISO-8601 UTC timestamps or None.
    All outputs are in minutes (float) or None if not computable.
    """
    metrics = {}
    
    # TTD = Detection - Impact Start
    if key_timestamps.get("impact_detection_time") and key_timestamps.get("impact_start_time"):
        metrics["ttd_minutes"] = diff_minutes(
            key_timestamps["impact_detection_time"],
            key_timestamps["impact_start_time"]
        )
        metrics["ttd_target_met"] = metrics["ttd_minutes"] <= 15# PIR checklist targetmetrics["ttd_kr_met"] = metrics["ttd_minutes"] <= 30  # P80 organizational target
    else:
        metrics["ttd_minutes"] = None
        metrics["ttd_notes"] = "Missing impact_start_time or impact_detection_time"

    # TTH = HOT Creation - Sev2 Breach (FY26 definition)
    if key_timestamps.get("hot_creation_time") and key_timestamps.get("sev2_breach_time"):
        metrics["tth_minutes"] = diff_minutes(
            key_timestamps["hot_creation_time"],
            key_timestamps["sev2_breach_time"]
        )
    elif key_timestamps.get("hot_creation_time") and key_timestamps.get("impact_start_time"):
        # Fallback: HOT creation - Impact Start (legacy definition)
        metrics["tth_minutes"] = diff_minutes(
            key_timestamps["hot_creation_time"],
            key_timestamps["impact_start_time"]
        )
        metrics["tth_notes"] = "Used impact_start_time as fallback (sev2_breach_time unavailable)"
    else:
        metrics["tth_minutes"] = None

    # TTR = Resolution - Impact Start (or Detection, depending on org convention)
    if key_timestamps.get("resolution_time") and key_timestamps.get("impact_start_time"):
        metrics["ttr_minutes"] = diff_minutes(
            key_timestamps["resolution_time"],
            key_timestamps["impact_start_time"]
        )
        metrics["ttr_target_met"] = metrics["ttr_minutes"] <= 120  # P80 target
    elif key_timestamps.get("resolution_time") and key_timestamps.get("impact_detection_time"):
        metrics["ttr_minutes"] = diff_minutes(
            key_timestamps["resolution_time"],
            key_timestamps["impact_detection_time"]
        )
        metrics["ttr_notes"] = "Computed from detection time (impact_start_time unavailable)"
    else:
        metrics["ttr_minutes"] = None

    # TTM = Mitigation - Sev2 Breach (FY26 primary metric)
    if key_timestamps.get("mitigation_time") and key_timestamps.get("sev2_breach_time"):
        metrics["ttm_minutes"] = diff_minutes(
            key_timestamps["mitigation_time"],
            key_timestamps["sev2_breach_time"]
        )
        metrics["ttm_target_met"] = metrics["ttm_minutes"] <= 120
    else:
        metrics["ttm_minutes"] = None

    # TTC = First External Comms - Sev2 Escalation
    if key_timestamps.get("first_external_comms_time") and key_timestamps.get("sev2_escalation_time"):
        metrics["ttc_minutes"] = diff_minutes(
            key_timestamps["first_external_comms_time"],
            key_timestamps["sev2_escalation_time"]
        )
        metrics["ttc_target_met"] = metrics["ttc_minutes"] <= 30
    elif key_timestamps.get("first_external_comms_time") and key_timestamps.get("hot_creation_time"):
        metrics["ttc_minutes"] = diff_minutes(
            key_timestamps["first_external_comms_time"],
            key_timestamps["hot_creation_time"]
        )
        metrics["ttc_notes"] = "Used hot_creation_time as proxy (sev2_escalation_time unavailable)"
    else:
        metrics["ttc_minutes"] = None
        if not key_timestamps.get("first_external_comms_time"):
            metrics["ttc_notes"] = "No external comms sent (may not apply if no external impact)"

    return metrics
```

### 3.2 Metric Formatting for PIR Output

Based on real PIR examples observed:
```
- Impact Start Time: 2026-03-0223:13:00 UTC
- Impact Detection Time: 2026-05-01 00:13:00 UTC
- Impact End Time: 2026-04-21 00:59:00 UTC
- HOT Creation Time: 2026-05-01 04:06:00 UTC
- Time to HOT: 0 days3 hours 53 mins
- Time to Detect: 59 days 1 hours 0 mins
- Time to Resolution: 49 days 1 hours 46 mins
```

Format: `{days} days {hours} hours {mins} mins` — drop days if 0.

