## 8. Organizational Goals Alignment

From [Core Engineering Incident Metrics Goals](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/TECHOPS/pages/5231843982/May+2025+-+Trust+Operations+Metrics+Review+Non-Security+Incidents+-+Drilldown):

| Metric | Target | PIR Action Type if Breached |
|---|---|---|
| 80% major HOTs detected via automation | Per incident: was it auto-detected? | PIR - TTD Action |
| P80 TTD ≤ 30 minutes | Per incident: TTD ≤ 30m? | PIR - TTD Action |
| P80 TTR ≤ 120 minutes | Per incident: TTR ≤ 120m? | PIR - TTR Action |
| No overdue high-priority PIR actions | Track action SLO compliance | N/A |
| Reduce date anomalies to zero | Validate timestamp consistency | Computation validation |

The `pir_drafter` should automatically flag when metrics breach these thresholds and propose corresponding action items with the correct link type.

