Key findings (5 non-negotiables → 5 machine-checkable rigor gates):

 1 Multi-seed statistics: ≥5 seeds (10 for SOTA claims) per Henderson 2018 /
   Bouthillier 2021. Single master_seed → SeedSequence.spawn() for full
   variance coverage. Mandate mean ± sample std + bootstrap 95% CI (10k
   resamples) + median/IQR. Comparisons via paired bootstrap, Wilcoxon
   signed-rank, or ASO (Dror 2019). LLM variant: ≥3 generations, pass@k /
   maj@k. SKILL exposes report_metric() that refuses n<5.
 2 K-fold/stratified CV: Decision tree (KFold / StratifiedKFold / GroupKFold /
   StratifiedGroupKFold / TimeSeriesSplit / IterativeStratification / nested
   CV for HPO). k=5 default, repeated k-fold when std-of-std matters.
   Mandatory GroupKFold when user_aaid/tenant_cloud_id/workspace_id present
   (silent-leakage #1 bug). Separate locked holdout verified via
   tecton_mlfs_client.verify_holdout_isolation. Walk-forward + embargo for
   temporal; ≥10 rolling origins (Bergmeir 2012).
 3 Ablation design: 7 ablation classes (component, hparam, data, capacity,
   loss, inference-time, feature). Forbid "bundle" ablations (>1 var changed),
   optimistic re-tuning, cherry-picked seeds. Required ablation_matrix.csv +
   plot + controlled_vars.json. Lipton/Steinhardt 2018 + Pineau 2021
   checklist.
 4 Failure-case taxonomy (3-axis): slice (pre-declared subgroups + sparsity
   flags), cluster (HDBSCAN on error embeddings, ≥5 named themes labeled by
   the AI), adversarial (CheckList, robustness perturbations, prompt-injection
   canaries for LLMs). LLM add-ons: hallucination, refusal, schema-violation,
   tool-call errors, toxicity. Artifacts: slice_metric_table.parquet,
   worst_k_examples.parquet, failure_taxonomy.md, robustness_report.md.
 5 Literature synthesis + rejected-alternatives: Both required before any run
   (blocking gate on Experiment, not Run). ≥8 cited works, ≥3 from last 12mo,
   ≥1 internal. Rejected-alternatives ≥3 with explicit falsifiability hooks
   (ADR-style).

