| **ML Lens** (dashboards + alert author) | Namespace read access (SSAM); Alert author via API | SLAuth (service-to-service); ASAP issuer allowlist | ML Platform team | `#ml-platform` / ML Lens onboarding flow |⚠️ Requires namespace registration + SSAM access level |
| **SignalFx** (detector authoring) | Shared Terraform token (`power` role); or `read_only` for queries | `X-SF-TOKEN` header; Vault-stored token for pipelines | Observability team | `#observability` / OBSHELP Jira project | ⚠️ Requires OBSHELP ticket for pipeline token access |
| **JSM Ops** (alert API + Slack) | Team Admin for integration setup; GenieKey for API | GenieKey (`Authorization: GenieKey {key}`); Slack OAuth | JSM Ops Platform / Team admins | Team Operations > Integrations > Add API integration | ⚠️ Requires team-level API integration creation |
| **Rovo-eval** | ConvoAI platform credentials; access to eval service | Internal Atlassian auth (ConvoAI) | Central AI / Agent Quality Pod | `#feedback-agent-evals` | ⚠️ Access via eval service portal (go/rovoeval) |
| **AIX-eval** | Artifactory package access; MLUGC data access; AI Gateway credentials | Databricks PAT; AI Gateway auth | AIX team | AIX team internal channels | ⚠️ Requires Databricks access + AI Gateway credentials |
| **Circuit Breaker** (ML-Engine) | SignalFx read for metrics; feature gate access for override | SignalFx token (read_only); feature flag service credentials | AIOps / JSM Ops team | Service team on-call; standard feature flag provisioning | ✅ Read via SignalFx (existing power role); ⚠️ Override requires feature gate access |
| **FinOps** (cost query) | Socrates/Databricks access; cost center visibility | Databricks PAT | Cloud FinOps team | `#fpa_and_finops` /FinOps Cost Champions | ⚠️ Requires Databricks workspace access to cost tables |
| **ORBIT** (context bind) | Registered consumer of Context Pack API | SLAuth (service-to-service) | ORBIT team (Danny Doan) | ORBIT team / Atlas ATLAS-118565 | 🔴 API still in development; requires coordination |
| **Audit Log** (sink) | StreamHub producer registration; audit-log-processor schema conformance | StreamHub auth; no separate audit API auth needed | Audit Log Platform team | Platform team onboarding | ⚠️ Agent attribution (actor_is_agent) not yet available (ENT-3675) |

