## Executive Summary

This document synthesizes research across Atlassian's internal platforms to produce the **Day-One Readiness access matrix** for 8 new tools required by the SRE AI Employee role. For each platform/tool, it identifies the required role/scope/integration, the access owner, and the request channel.

