|---------|-----------|--------|
| `rovo_eval_create_experiment` | name, dataset_id, feature_flags, judge_type | Experiment ID, status |
| `rovo_eval_run` | experiment_id, agent_config | Run ID, progress status |
| `rovo_eval_get_results` | run_id | Scores (precision, recall, F1, pass_rate), per-query breakdown |
