## 7. orbit_context_client

### Gap Validation
**Existing MCPs checked:** Teamwork Graph (TWG) is available but ORBIT is a **layer above** TWG — it adds ML-scored relevance, personalization, and context packaging. TWG provides raw graph data; ORBIT provides ranked, budgeted, purpose-scoped context packs.
**Gap confirmed:** No MCP exposes ORBIT's Context Pack API, relevance scoring, or layer assignment.

### Underlying Platform/API Surface

**ORBIT** is the Personalization & Context Packaging Layer for Rovo:

**Core concept:** Per-user view of Teamwork Graph entities, ML-scored and layered:
- **Inner orbit** — highest relevance (owned items, active incidents, current sprint)
- **Near orbit** — moderate relevance (team projects, watched items)
- **Outer orbit** — peripheral relevance (department-level, followed goals)

**Context Pack v1 API contract:**

| Field Group | Contents |
|-------------|----------|
| Identity | tenantId, userId, packId, schemaVersion |
| Purpose & TTL | purpose (HOME_WORKSPACE_RENDER / SEARCH_QUERY_GROUNDING / CHAT_TURN_GROUNDING / AGENT_PLAN / AGENT_EXECUTE), createdAt, ttl/expiry |
| Budget | maxEntities, maxArtifacts, maxEdges, tokenBudget |
| Entities | TwG entity refs with layer, orbitScore, reasonCodes |
| Artifacts | Typed references (tickets/docs/repos/PRs/incidents) with title, snippet, status |
| Graph slice | Minimal edges among included items |
| Policy & audit | Permission checks, provenance, policy decisions |

**Data model:**
```
ContextPackEntity { entityRef, layer (INNER/NEAR/OUTER), orbitScore, reasonCodes[], explanationSignals }
ContextPackArtifact { artifactRef, layer, orbitScore, title, snippet, productType, url, status, ownerRefs[] }
ContextPackEdge { fromEntityRef, toEntityRef, edgeType }
```

**Purposes control:** Which entity/artifact types are allowed, budget strictness, extra policies (e.g., no broad-scoped artifacts in AGENT_EXECUTE).

### Proposed Tool Surface

| Command | Parameters | Output |
|---------|-----------|--------|
| `orbit_get_context_pack` | user_id, purpose (AGENT_PLAN/AGENT_EXECUTE), entity_types_filter | Context pack (entities + artifacts + edges) |
| `orbit_get_entity_score` | user_id, entity_ari | Layer assignment, orbit score, reason codes |
| `orbit_bind_context` | agent_session_id, pack_id | Confirmation of context binding to agent session |
| `orbit_list_layers` | user_id, layer (INNER/NEAR/OUTER) | Entities in specified layer with scores |
| `orbit_refresh_signals` | user_id, signal_type (activity/ownership/urgency) | Updated orbit scores after signal refresh |

### Auth/Scope Requirements
- ORBIT service API access (ASAP JWT)
- User-scoped context (must respect TwG permission boundaries)
- Audit log sink for every context pack generation (compliance)

