## Day-One Readiness Access Matrix

| Capability | Access Required | Auth Mechanism | Setup Step |
|-----------|----------------|----------------|-----------|
| **ML Lens Dashboards** | ML Lens service read access | ASAP JWT | Onboard service in ML Lens config |
| **ML Lens Alert Author** | `ml-lens:alerts:write` scope | ASAP JWT + team membership | Register as alert author in ML Lens |
| **SignalFx Detector Authoring** | SignalFx API Token (team-scoped) | SFx auth token + Sauron config | Team onboarded in Sauron; `.sauron.yml` configured |
| **JSM Ops + Slack Integration** | JSM Ops Alert API access + Slack webhook | ASAP JWT + Slack app token | JSM Ops team configured; Slack integration ID |
| **ORBIT Bind** | ORBIT service agent registration | Agent identity + user delegation | Register agent in ORBIT agent registry |
| **Audit Log Sink** | Audit event write access | Service audit principal | Configure audit stream in compliance config |
| **Socrates/Databricks (FinOps)** | `production.*` table read | OAuth2 (Databricks) or ASAP (SGW) | Databricks OAuth login; warehouse `af2491cd959ef264` |
| **Rovo Eval** | ConvoAI evaluation permissions | Atlassian SSO + feature flag | Evaluation feature flag enabled; tenant registered |
| **AIX-Eval** | AI Gateway + Databricks/ML Studio | AI Gateway credentials + Databricks auth | AI Gateway access granted; ML Studio workspace |
| **Circuit Breaker Admin** | Service admin (`web-admin` endpoint) | Service proxy + Switcheroo | Feature gate: `enable-*-cb-support`; admin role |

