   HPO constraints: max concurrent ≤5, continuous params need trailing zeros,
   Karpenter cold-start 2–5 min must not be misread as failure.
 3 tecton_mlfs_client — Wraps MLFS Java SDK
   (com.atlassian.mlp.featurestore:java-client-sdk:0.0.36) with fallback to
   legacy Tecton (workspace=prod). Auth: mTLS in-cluster / JWT
