   model_program/version/framework, compliance{data_class, tenant_scope, 
   pii_handled, fairness_checks_passed, red_team_status, safetensors_only},
   env{conda_yaml, pip_requirements, dockerfile, python_version, 
   cuda_version}, input_schema{format, payload, example},
   lineage{mlflow_run_uri, training_dataset_uri, feature_views[], 
   parent_model_version, ablation_report_uri, architecture_comparison_uri},
   and audit{agent_id, intent, evidence_uris, policy_pack_version, 
   orbit_context_ref}.
 2 §2 R#6 (Deployment & Rollout, 🟢/🟡/🔴) — Drives
   deployment_manifest_and_rollout SKILL + teamserve_sagemaker_deployer,
   aigateway_router_config, spinnaker_micros_descriptor_editor TOOLs.
   TEAMServe endpoint pattern
   grpc-teamserve-{region}.{env}.services.kitt-inf.net:443; SageMaker
   ml.g5.xlarge with auto-scaling 1–3; LLaMA 3.1 8B → GPT-OSS Safeguard 20B
   cascade exemplar; SageMaker→TEAMServe migration ~$5.6M/yr.
 3 §4.4 + §10.5 non-negotiable deployment manifest — intent, non_goals, 
   impacted{services,files,endpoints}, declared_invariants (p95 latency, 
   error_rate_max, fail_open_kill_switch, per_tenant_rate_limit, az_rotation,
   health_check_decoupled, drift_floor), risk_classification{tier, rationale,
   blast_radius, data_class_unchanged, tenant_scope_unchanged}, 
   test_and_verification_plan{pre_deploy, post_deploy}, 
   rollback_plan{trigger_conditions, method, target_version, 
   estimated_recovery_minutes, rehearsed_at}, 
   post_deploy_monitoring_plan{ml_lens, signalfx_iac, slo_targets, 
   on_call_channel, auto_rollback_enabled}, audit_trail.
 4 §9 rollout state-machine — Pre-prod → Shadow → Canary → 50/50 A/B →
   significance gate → cutover within 25–45 min; circuit breaker armed at 20%
   errors / 60 s with auto-rollback. Derived deployer-TOOL primitives:
   start_shadow, set_traffic_split, await_significance_gate,
   complete_cutover(deadline_minutes∈[25,45]), arm_circuit_breaker,
   auto_rollback, set_feature_flag, verify_invariants.
 5 §10.5 guardrail wiring — Cross-tenant or new data-class → 🔴 (SKILL
   refuses); novel-arch/new compute/A/B ramp → 🟡 confirm; circuit-breaker
   activation and rehearsed-scope rollback → 🟢. Auto-rollback is 🟢 only when
   rollback_plan.rehearsed_at is non-null.
 6 Tool boundaries — spinnaker_micros_descriptor_editor should wrap bitbucket
   MCP for PR authoring (avoid duplication) and add Spinnaker-specific
   trigger_pipeline/wait_for_stage/cancel. aigateway_router_config owns
   OpenAI/Anthropic/Bedrock/Gemini/internal route configs and shadow-mirroring
   at the gateway layer.
 7 Day-One Readiness rows proposed for all four TOOLs (Tarot v3 write scope,
   Deployment Store S3 replication, MLflow tracking URI, TEAMServe mTLS,
   SageMaker IAM, AI Gateway admin, Launchpad, Bitbucket PR + Micros
