  savings drivers (monthly): 1) p5en.48xlarge (GPU) Teamserve runs 16 replicas  
  of p5en.48xlarge . Teamserve: $67,791/month SageMaker list price:             
  $47.8538/hr Estimated SageMaker effective hourly: $23.52/hr (see              
