Full report written to worker_13/outputs/facet.md (11 sections, ~800 lines).
Key findings:

MCP capability baseline (verified)

 • atlassian: Confluence (page CRUD, live-doc, CQL search, inline/footer
   comments) + Jira (CRUD, JQL, transitions, attachments).
 • slack: post / scheduled-post (Unix postAt) / threaded replies / realtime
   search / user lookup — sufficient for ack-in-seconds + 30-min cadence
   threading.
 • google_drive: docs + sheets create/update/permissions + Tasks; no native 
   scheduler.
 • gmail: send/draft/reply + Gmail-query search + ISO-8601 sendTime
   scheduling.
 • socrates: async SQL only (create_query → poll get_query_status); read-only.
 • bitbucket: branch/commit/files, PR
   (create/edit/merge/approve/comment/diff), Pipelines (list/run/steps/logs) —
   enables full rollback-PR flow.

Per-skill SOPs encoded (each with explicit SOP outline, step-by-step MCP
mapping, and gap list):

 1 ml_observability_and_slo — KS(>0.1)/KL(>0.2)/cosine(<0.60)/PSI(>0.25) drift
   + 20%/60s breaker + OTel/gevent/ALB invariants. Gaps: ml_lens_query_client,
   signalfx_detector_iac, circuit_breaker_control.
 2 drift_triggered_retraining (SOP-1) —
   detect→correlate→reproduce→parallel-retrain→6-stage
   eval→register→propose-deploy→canary(1→5→25→50→100%, ≥24h)→ORBIT append;
   Symphony 🟢/🟡/🔴 by σ bands. Gaps: ML Lens, eval runners, ORBIT, breaker,
   deploy invoker.
 3 ml_incident_response (SOP-3) — TTD<15min, TTR<2h, PIR ≤5BD; full MCP
   mapping for Slack ack/thread/cadence + Jira transitions + Bitbucket
   rollback PR + Socrates correlation. Gaps: circuit_breaker_control,
   pir_drafter (TTD/TTH/TTR/TTC), ML Lens, JSM Ops.
 4 ml_evaluation_protocol — 6-stage
   (offline→adhoc→released→packaging→post-packaging→shadow/AB/continuous);
   AI-native non-negotiables (categorized failures, all slices, mean±std
   multi-seed, full k-fold, calibration+CIs+fairness); rovo-eval (multi-turn
   agent) vs AIX-eval (classical/single-turn, prompt-opt) selection criteria.
   Gaps: both eval runners + ML Lens.
 5 ml_launch_review_gate — 8 automated gates (privacy / model card / rollback
   / drift monitor / alerting / eval / cost / autonomy-tier ↔ L1-L5). Gaps: ML
