   SVIDs (1 h rotation); AWS IAM role teamserve-sagemaker-deployer for
   SageMaker CRUD, ECR pull, PassRole, KMS, CloudWatch; TEAMServe
   deploy/traffic-split scopes; Tier-3 for prod endpoint create and for the §9
   50/50 cutover traffic flip.
 3 aigateway_router_config — Admin OIDC token only; scopes
   aigateway:{route,rollout,model-alias,rate-limit,circuit-breaker}:write with
   no provider-key scopes (gateway-managed); no AWS role assumed by the agent;
   Tier-3 on write.
 4 spinnaker_micros_descriptor_editor — Composite credential surface: reuses 
   the existing Bitbucket MCP for PR-author leg, plus Spinnaker Fiat
   x509/SLAuth (WRITE+EXECUTE on program app), Micros OIDC (descriptor/env
   write, env-scoped), LaunchDarkly admin token + SDK key (flag CRUD scoped to
   <program>.*); Tier-3 on prod pipeline trigger / merge.


