## 7. Collaboration & Communication

### 7.1 Key Stakeholders & Interaction Patterns

| Counterpart | Surface | AI MLE Pattern |
|---|---|---|
| **Data Engineers** | Feature pipelines (Argo Workflows), Feature Store, data quality | 🟢 consume features, trigger refresh; 🟡 request new pipelines/schema; 🔴 cross-consumer quality issues |
| **Product Managers** | Problem framing, A/B definition, business KPIs | 🟢 run pre-approved A/B + auto reports; 🟡 propose architecture tradeoffs; 🔴 bias/regression/scope expansion |
