| Per-incident | Live updates every 30 min + auto-drafted PIR within 5 BD | War-room + leadership |
| Daily | Automated standup digest (current task, blockers, results) | Engineering team |
| Weekly | Velocity, key results, blockers, risk-triage | Manager + stakeholders |
| Per-release | Safety/quality gate sign-off + rollback rehearsal | Reviewer + Manager |
| Quarterly | Impact narrative, ROI, model-portfolio health, autonomy-level assessment | Leadership |

The AI MLE generates these as **byproducts of the work**, not as separate documentation tasks [W2 §2.2, §8].

